# Force LF endings for shell scripts regardless of platform checkout
# settings. deploy/user-data.sh gets pasted verbatim into EC2's "User
# data" field and run by cloud-init on Linux -- a CRLF shebang line
# (`#!/bin/bash\r`) fails with "bad interpreter: No such file or
# directory" on Linux. Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) would
# otherwise silently convert this to CRLF on disk.
*.sh text eol=lf
